{"id":"inocente","lemma":"inocente","pos":"adj","rank":926,"glosses":["innocent (free from guilt)","innocent (bearing no legal responsibility for a wrongful act)","naive (lacking experience, wisdom, or judgement)"],"ipa":"/i.nuˈsẽ.tɨ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/14/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-inocente.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-inocente.wav.mp3","forms":{"plural":"inocentes"},"examples":[{"text":"Ninguém é inocente.","en":"No one is innocent.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270796","words":[{"g":"no one"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Como sabemos que ele é inocente?","en":"How do we know that he's innocent?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"to be aware, to know","l":"saber"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"É uma mentira inocente.","en":"It is a white lie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/843545","words":[{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"lie"},null]},{"text":"Nós somos inocentes.","en":"We're innocent.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Ele era jovem e inocente.","en":"He was young and innocent.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"young, youthful"},{"g":"and"},null]}]}